#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:82
#: b5b87c975a76425d99f90177fa4bd674
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:83
#: ff5651ae69954926a47387e3a3c49c2c
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the R2 (UART2_RX) pin. It supports all RC "
"protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details for a "
"specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` is set to "
"\"23\", by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""
"RC输入配置在R2（UART2_RX）引脚，支持除PPM以外的所有RC协议。特定RC系统的详细信息请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。:ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 默认设置为 「23」以启用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:85
#: 9612586ff3df46659d1ba12c050e9416
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to T2 and :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` "
"be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort需连接T2，且须将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:87
#: 875d79ae6d7f43f5ba1fc45ec3cd8bf8
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a T2 connection, in addition to R2, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF除需连接R2外，还需连接T2，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 "
"「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:89
#: 880e9b5c5afd4bad8051974c005de4fb
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connecton to T2 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set "
":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr "SRXL2需连接T2，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:91
#: 83c855aebaf7464cae48464b29198066
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:94
#: fe9646bd312649fc872279ffb71f6fb5
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:96
#: 5b812fc2acd645a98e6430da6cbe8490
msgid ""
"The autopilot  supports OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver). The defaults are also setup to allow DJI Goggle OSD support on "
"UART4. Both the internal analog OSD and the DisplayPort OSD can be used "
"simultaneously by setting :ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` = 5"
msgstr ""
"飞控支持通过 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1（MAX7456驱动）使用OSD。默认配置同时支持通过UART4使用DJI "
"Goggle OSD。通过将 :ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` 设置为5，可同时使用内置模拟OSD和DisplayPort "
"OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:100
#: da6649577c8b43f8b636e223913ef536
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:101
#: e104fcab26c94969b1e8bb937dd3c6fe
msgid ""
"The BLITZ Wing H743 has 13 PWM outputs. The first 8 outputs support bi-"
"directional DShot and DShot, as well as all PWM types. Outputs 9-10 support "
"DShot, as well as all PWM types and outputs 11-12 only support PWM. Output "
"13 is pre-configured for serial LED."
msgstr ""
"BLITZ Wing H743 "
"共有13路PWM输出。前8路输出支持双向DShot和DShot及所有PWM类型。输出9-10支持DShot及所有PWM类型，输出11-12仅支持PWM。输出13预配置为串行LED。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:103
#: 847a3401759f42939d4c4eefe7c3497b
msgid "The PWM are in in five groups:"
msgstr "PWM分为五组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:106
#: a4501f0d3d5647ffa1b8c8ee5841a678
msgid "PWM 1-2 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-2 在第1组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:107
#: 7cd2be390be441c08c200c6d9c1e31ad
msgid "PWM 3-6 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3-6 在第2组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:108
#: c14b7ba8e2324027853743518f6b9eb3
msgid "PWM 7-10 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 7-10 在第3组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:109
#: e05bfb699d60483092b785c03655eeaa
msgid "PWM 11-12 in group4"
msgstr "PWM 11-12 在第4组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:110
#: 9ceb324b64f442959531033b7dc5f94e
msgid "PWM 13 in group5"
msgstr "PWM 13 在第5组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:112
#: 633d0f0c82f74526aeccafe88f3817e5
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出速率。如果某组中任一通道使用 DShot，则该组中所有通道都必须使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:117
#: f1e82d3ac8764b619d47f0c9543d6891
msgid "Video Power Control"
msgstr "视频电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:119
#: 0b03cae94cb44b76a7178a25fc778630
msgid ""
"The 9V video power can be turned off/on  using GPIO 81 which is already "
"assigned by default to RELAY2.  This relay can be controlled either from the"
" GCS or using a transmitter channel (See :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions`)"
msgstr ""
"9V视频电源可通过GPIO 81进行开关控制，该GPIO默认已分配给RELAY2。此继电器可通过地面站或遥控器通道进行控制（参见 "
":ref:`common-auxiliary-functions`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:122
#: 59226fdc00884c7d980d1a7431e96bc3
msgid "Camera Switch"
msgstr "摄像头切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:123
#: 4285fe2d853948df8aee1cc297ff9069
msgid ""
"The camera inputs (Vi1,Vi2) can be switched using GPIO 82 which is already "
"assigned by default to RELAY3.  This relay can be controlled either from the"
" GCS or using a transmitter channel (See :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions`)"
msgstr ""
"摄像头输入（Vi1、Vi2）可通过GPIO 82进行切换，该GPIO默认已分配给RELAY3。此继电器可通过地面站或遥控器通道进行控制（参见 "
":ref:`common-auxiliary-functions`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:126
#: bcfa630a98304ac8b142fab217d978a4
msgid "Analog Airspeed Input"
msgstr "模拟空速输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:128
#: 3fed691474454d1b825d3f0dfc813e9b
msgid "The analog airspeed pin is \"4\" and is marked \"AIR\" on the board."
msgstr "模拟空速引脚为 「4」，在板上标注为 「AIR」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:131
#: 2cb50c4137364693bbb53af15a8e5cb4
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:133
#: 8f449314f3a6471a9364ff96f6d217b5
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor and  current sensor. The voltage "
"sensor can handle up to 8S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "该板内置电压传感器和电流传感器。电压传感器最高支持8S LiPo电池。"

