#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:148
#: 14187594da9e4d89bffddcd98384af08
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:150
#: 04c893b2d53145269c23c88bd97d16bb
msgid ""
"The BLITZ Wing H743 does not have a builtin compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass to I2C pins."
msgstr "BLITZ Wing H743 无内置罗盘，但可通过I2C引脚连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:154
#: 91c915fc62a4428ab9fa949139ed9545
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:156
#: 706c39e1eea143fd9cfadfed38e3f928
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled "
"\"BlitzWingH743\"."
msgstr ""
"该板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 的 「BlitzWingH743」 子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:159
#: 0782db1fdfea4d679b808e859e2229e7
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:161
#: c302de0481f5454899d8b515707600af
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件加载可通过按住引导程序按钮插入USB以DFU方式完成。然后使用您喜欢的DFU加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blitzh743wing.rst:165
#: 1efaefd044aa4b88a74925e3bcbced0d
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Later updates should be done with the "
"\\*.apj firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任意ArduPilot地面站软件更新固件。后续更新请使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
